{
  "name": "Hybrid Transformation",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to control the lycanthropic curse that courses through your veins. As a Bonus Action, you transform into a special hybrid form for up to 1 hour. You can speak, use equipment, and wear armor while in this form, and can revert to your normal form as a Bonus Action. You automatically revert to your normal form if you fall unconscious or die.</p><p>This feature replaces the rules for lycanthropy in the Monster Manual. You can use this feature twice, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or a Long Rest. Alternatively, you can expend a use of your Blood Maledict feature to use it again.</p>",
